  },
  "Runs in the background — keep reading. Untranslated pages are translated first, which can take a while. Follow it in Window › Jobs (%@).": {
    "en": "Runs in the background — keep reading. Untranslated pages are translated first, which can take a while. Follow it in Window › Jobs (%@).",
