  },
  "Language packs are downloaded from the translation panel the first time a book is translated. Manage downloaded packs in System Settings › General › Language & Region › Translation Languages.": {
    "en": "Language packs are downloaded from the translation panel the first time a book is translated. Manage downloaded packs in Settings › Experimental.",
