  },
  "This book's language is set to %@, the same language it would be translated into. If the book is in another language, choose it under Book's language at the top of the translation panel; otherwise translate into another language.": {
    "en": "This book's language is set to %@, the same language it would be translated into. If the book is in another language, choose it under Book's language at the top of the translation panel; otherwise translate into another language.",
    "ko": "이 책의 원문 언어가 번역할 언어와 같은 %@(으)로 되어 있습니다. 책이 다른 언어라면 번역 패널 맨 위 '원문 언어'에서 고르고, 아니라면 다른 언어로 번역하세요."
  },
  "Windows text recognition reads horizontal lines. Vertical (top-to-bottom) text may not be recognized, so some balloons can stay untranslated.": {
